1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:05,044
The Quick slider. A volume and brightness
track that follows your finger.

2
00:00:06,278 --> 00:00:08,138
Turn on Advanced mode.

3
00:00:08,178 --> 00:00:10,638
The Quick slider comes with the Dock bar.

4
00:00:10,678 --> 00:00:15,089
Open Gesture Volume, switch
on Advanced mode and confirm.

5
00:00:15,685 --> 00:00:19,845
Meet the Dock. Back on your home screen,
the round button is now the Dock:

6
00:00:19,885 --> 00:00:22,091
a slim tab on the edge.

7
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:24,560
Swipe the tab up or down.

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:29,493
It grows into the Quick slider, and every
bit you swipe moves the level one step.

9
00:00:29,805 --> 00:00:33,590
Touch the track to set it.
Touch anywhere on the open track:

10
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:38,392
the level jumps to your finger and follows
it. Let go and it tucks back in.

11
00:00:38,708 --> 00:00:42,443
Or press a volume key.
With Volume keys on Instant,

12
00:00:42,483 --> 00:00:47,343
a key opens the slider on the spot
and moves it one step per press.

13
00:00:47,383 --> 00:00:50,170
Instant needs the accessibility service.

14
00:00:50,536 --> 00:00:51,971
Open its settings.

15
00:00:52,011 --> 00:00:56,421
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Quick slider.

16
00:00:56,461 --> 00:00:59,069
The preview runs your slider as it is.

17
00:00:59,378 --> 00:01:03,038
Pick a fill.
Open Animation and choose a fill.

18
00:01:03,078 --> 00:01:05,488
Shaders and Surge are live effects;

19
00:01:05,528 --> 00:01:08,066
the preview at the top runs each one.

20
00:01:09,628 --> 00:01:11,088
Celebrate at the top.

21
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:16,338
With Celebrate at the top on, a flourish
plays when the level reaches 100%.

22
00:01:16,378 --> 00:01:18,067
Pick the one you like.

23
00:01:18,403 --> 00:01:23,183
Choose what it adjusts. Under Content,
pick Brightness or one volume.

24
00:01:23,223 --> 00:01:25,133
Adaptive follows whatever is playing:

25
00:01:25,173 --> 00:01:27,824
a call, an alarm, or media.

26
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,705
Up next: The Deck.
